@startuml
title VN Digital Trust v0.1 - logical deployment on ~16 GB host
left to right direction
node "User device" as Client {
  artifact "Browser" as Browser
}
node "Local host / VM (~16 GB RAM)" as Host {
  node "TLS boundary" as TLS {
    artifact "Reverse proxy" as Proxy
  }
  node "VDT application process" as App {
    artifact "UI + policy + domain modules" as Modules
    artifact "Sequential background work" as Jobs
  }
  database "Transactional metadata store" as DB
  folder "Protected evidence storage" as Evidence
  folder "Consistent backup set" as Backup
}
cloud "External CRM + CRM identity" as CRM
cloud "Controlled lab runner + receiver" as Lab
Browser --> Proxy : protected connection
Proxy --> Modules : authenticated request
Modules --> DB : versioned metadata / audit
Modules --> Evidence : gated revision bytes
Jobs --> DB : recheck rights + version
DB --> Backup : coordinated snapshot
Evidence --> Backup : coordinated copy
CRM --> Browser : observed CRM behavior
Lab --> Browser : synthetic test output
Browser --> Modules : manual upload / reference
note bottom of Host
One SME, two branches in one deployment.
No required broker, cluster or AI server.
Stack, sizing limits and restore test follow later.
end note
@enduml
